{"id":"sample_c1-nasa-moonbound2","videoId":"ttiLcMUQq80","title":"Moonbound Episode 2 | For All Humanity","author":"NASA","videoDuration":2203000,"lang":"en","transcriptHash":"371285febe5dc7dd5bbd7c781a2e3435","source":"supadata","start":120000,"end":240000,"sentences":[{"id":"s0_120341","text":"These are test flights, and they're test flights for a reason, because we're making sure that that vehicle's ready to go from an operational standpoint, from that point further.","words":[{"w":"These","start":120341,"end":120560},{"w":"are","start":120560,"end":120706},{"w":"test","start":120706,"end":120889},{"w":"flights,","start":120889,"end":121217},{"w":"and","start":121592,"end":121712},{"w":"they're","start":121712,"end":121952},{"w":"test","start":121952,"end":122103},{"w":"flights","start":122103,"end":122343},{"w":"for","start":122343,"end":122506},{"w":"a","start":122506,"end":122587},{"w":"reason,","start":122587,"end":122912},{"w":"because","start":122912,"end":123238},{"w":"we're","start":123238,"end":123482},{"w":"making","start":123482,"end":123767},{"w":"sure","start":123767,"end":123970},{"w":"that","start":124846,"end":125112},{"w":"that","start":125112,"end":125378},{"w":"vehicle's","start":125378,"end":125910},{"w":"ready","start":125910,"end":126229},{"w":"to","start":126229,"end":126388},{"w":"go","start":126388,"end":126548},{"w":"from","start":126548,"end":126813},{"w":"an","start":126813,"end":126973},{"w":"operational","start":126973,"end":127599},{"w":"standpoint,","start":127599,"end":128224},{"w":"from","start":128224,"end":128516},{"w":"that","start":128516,"end":128808},{"w":"point","start":128808,"end":129158},{"w":"further.","start":129158,"end":129684}],"start":120341,"end":129684,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,2,4,6,11,15,21,25],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"これはテスト飛行で、理由があるからテスト飛行なのです。その車両が運用上の観点から、その先の段階で準備ができているかどうかを確認しているのです。","edge":false,"segFrom":44,"segTo":49},{"id":"s1_130643","text":"And Artemis is no different.","words":[{"w":"And","start":130643,"end":130896},{"w":"Artemis","start":130896,"end":131402},{"w":"is","start":131402,"end":131592},{"w":"no","start":131592,"end":131782},{"w":"different.","start":131782,"end":132478}],"start":130643,"end":132478,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,1,3],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"アーティミスも同じです。","edge":false,"segFrom":50,"segTo":50},{"id":"s2_133980","text":"NASA was established to undertake big, bold endeavors in air and space to undertake the near impossible.","words":[{"w":"NASA","start":133980,"end":134336},{"w":"was","start":134336,"end":134621},{"w":"established","start":134621,"end":135476},{"w":"to","start":135476,"end":135690},{"w":"undertake","start":135690,"end":136274},{"w":"big,","start":136274,"end":136566},{"w":"bold","start":136566,"end":136858},{"w":"endeavors","start":136858,"end":137442},{"w":"in","start":137650,"end":137825},{"w":"air","start":137825,"end":138059},{"w":"and","start":138059,"end":138292},{"w":"space","start":138292,"end":138643},{"w":"to","start":138643,"end":138818},{"w":"undertake","start":138818,"end":139329},{"w":"the","start":139329,"end":139534},{"w":"near","start":139534,"end":139789},{"w":"impossible.","start":139789,"end":140403}],"start":133980,"end":140403,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,3,8,12,14],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"NASAは、空と宇宙で大きく、大胆な事業を成し遂げるために設立されました。ほとんど不可能なことを成し遂げるために。","edge":false,"segFrom":51,"segTo":54},{"id":"s3_140778","text":"The next stop is America's return to the lunar environment.","words":[{"w":"The","start":140778,"end":141025},{"w":"next","start":141025,"end":141334},{"w":"stop","start":141334,"end":141643},{"w":"is","start":141643,"end":141829},{"w":"America's","start":141829,"end":142447},{"w":"return","start":142447,"end":142712},{"w":"to","start":142712,"end":142826},{"w":"the","start":142826,"end":142978},{"w":"lunar","start":142978,"end":143205},{"w":"environment.","start":143205,"end":143698}],"start":140778,"end":143698,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,4,6],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"次の目的地は、アメリカが月周辺環境に戻ることです。","edge":false,"segFrom":55,"segTo":56},{"id":"s4_143906","text":"What we learned from that mission is going to help enable America's return to the lunar surface.","words":[{"w":"What","start":143906,"end":144109},{"w":"we","start":144109,"end":144230},{"w":"learned","start":144230,"end":144554},{"w":"from","start":144554,"end":144757},{"w":"that","start":144757,"end":144959},{"w":"mission","start":144959,"end":145283},{"w":"is","start":145283,"end":145442},{"w":"going","start":145442,"end":145759},{"w":"to","start":145759,"end":145918},{"w":"help","start":145918,"end":146182},{"w":"enable","start":146182,"end":146553},{"w":"America's","start":146553,"end":147082},{"w":"return","start":147082,"end":147452},{"w":"to","start":147452,"end":147589},{"w":"the","start":147589,"end":147771},{"w":"lunar","start":147771,"end":148044},{"w":"surface.","start":148044,"end":148453}],"start":143906,"end":148453,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,3,6,11,13],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"そのミッションから学んだことは、アメリカが月面に戻るのを可能にするのに役立ちます。","edge":false,"segFrom":57,"segTo":59},{"id":"s5_148828","text":"When we arrive to the moon, we're there to stay.","words":[{"w":"When","start":148828,"end":149008},{"w":"we","start":149008,"end":149116},{"w":"arrive","start":149116,"end":149368},{"w":"to","start":149368,"end":149476},{"w":"the","start":149476,"end":149620},{"w":"moon,","start":149620,"end":149842},{"w":"we're","start":149842,"end":150065},{"w":"there","start":150065,"end":150287},{"w":"to","start":150287,"end":150399},{"w":"stay.","start":150399,"end":150621}],"start":148828,"end":150621,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,3,6,8],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"月に到着したら、そこで滞在します。","edge":false,"segFrom":60,"segTo":61},{"id":"s6_153583","text":"Our mission calls for four names.","words":[{"w":"Our","start":153583,"end":153872},{"w":"mission","start":153872,"end":154451},{"w":"calls","start":154451,"end":154885},{"w":"for","start":154885,"end":155175},{"w":"four","start":155175,"end":155537},{"w":"names.","start":155537,"end":156043}],"start":153583,"end":156043,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,2,4],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"私たちの任務は四人の名前を必要としています","edge":false,"segFrom":63,"segTo":63},{"id":"s7_156961","text":"It's difficult to pick just four, from a group that by its very definition attracts the best and the brightest that humanity has to offer,","words":[{"w":"It's","start":156961,"end":157224},{"w":"difficult","start":157224,"end":157750},{"w":"to","start":157750,"end":157908},{"w":"pick","start":157908,"end":158171},{"w":"just","start":158171,"end":158597},{"w":"four,","start":158597,"end":159107},{"w":"from","start":159107,"end":159533},{"w":"a","start":159533,"end":159703},{"w":"group","start":159703,"end":160214},{"w":"that","start":160214,"end":160524},{"w":"by","start":160524,"end":160710},{"w":"its","start":160710,"end":160959},{"w":"very","start":160959,"end":161269},{"w":"definition","start":161269,"end":161951},{"w":"attracts","start":161951,"end":162510},{"w":"the","start":162510,"end":162758},{"w":"best","start":162758,"end":163057},{"w":"and","start":163057,"end":163297},{"w":"the","start":163297,"end":163536},{"w":"brightest","start":163536,"end":164135},{"w":"that","start":164135,"end":164393},{"w":"humanity","start":164393,"end":164858},{"w":"has","start":164858,"end":165064},{"w":"to","start":165064,"end":165219},{"w":"offer,","start":165219,"end":165723}],"start":156961,"end":165723,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,2,6,9,14,20],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"その定義上、最も優秀で才能ある人々を引き寄せるグループから、たった四人を選ぶのは難しいです","edge":false,"segFrom":64,"segTo":69},{"id":"s8_165723","text":"as humanity looks to find its place among the stars.","words":[{"w":"as","start":165723,"end":165940},{"w":"humanity","start":165940,"end":166588},{"w":"looks","start":166588,"end":167021},{"w":"to","start":167021,"end":167237},{"w":"find","start":167237,"end":167597},{"w":"its","start":167597,"end":167832},{"w":"place","start":167832,"end":168184},{"w":"among","start":168184,"end":168536},{"w":"the","start":168536,"end":168771},{"w":"stars.","start":168771,"end":169182}],"start":165723,"end":169182,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,2,5,7],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"人類は星々の間で自分の場所を見つけようとしています","edge":false,"segFrom":69,"segTo":70},{"id":"s9_170433","text":"My name is Norm Knight.","words":[{"w":"My","start":170433,"end":170543},{"w":"name","start":170543,"end":170726},{"w":"is","start":170726,"end":170836},{"w":"Norm","start":170836,"end":171019},{"w":"Knight.","start":171019,"end":171312}],"start":170433,"end":171312,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,2],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"私の名前はノーム・ナイトです","edge":false,"segFrom":71,"segTo":71},{"id":"s10_171312","text":"I'm the director of flight operations at NASA Johnson Space Center.","words":[{"w":"I'm","start":171312,"end":171458},{"w":"the","start":171458,"end":171605},{"w":"director","start":171605,"end":171934},{"w":"of","start":171934,"end":172085},{"w":"flight","start":172085,"end":172438},{"w":"operations","start":172438,"end":172993},{"w":"at","start":172993,"end":173144},{"w":"NASA","start":173144,"end":173368},{"w":"Johnson","start":173368,"end":173726},{"w":"Space","start":173726,"end":173995},{"w":"Center.","start":173995,"end":174353}],"start":171312,"end":174353,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,3,6],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"私はNASAジョンソン宇宙センターの飛行運用部長です","edge":false,"segFrom":71,"segTo":73},{"id":"s11_175313","text":"Well, let me tell you a little bit about what flight operations does.","words":[{"w":"Well,","start":175313,"end":175472},{"w":"let","start":175472,"end":175577},{"w":"me","start":175577,"end":175657},{"w":"tell","start":175657,"end":175789},{"w":"you","start":175789,"end":175895},{"w":"a","start":175895,"end":175948},{"w":"little","start":175948,"end":176133},{"w":"bit","start":176133,"end":176238},{"w":"about","start":176238,"end":176397},{"w":"what","start":176397,"end":176757},{"w":"flight","start":176757,"end":177260},{"w":"operations","start":177260,"end":178051},{"w":"does.","start":178051,"end":178483}],"start":175313,"end":178483,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,1,5,8,10],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"では、飛行運用が何をするのか少しお話しします","edge":false,"segFrom":74,"segTo":75},{"id":"s12_179233","text":"You could think of us as a service provider to the major programs at NASA, both for low Earth orbit and for our exploration goals to Moon and Mars.","words":[{"w":"You","start":179233,"end":179414},{"w":"could","start":179414,"end":179686},{"w":"think","start":179686,"end":179958},{"w":"of","start":179958,"end":180093},{"w":"us","start":180093,"end":180229},{"w":"as","start":180229,"end":180365},{"w":"a","start":180365,"end":180456},{"w":"service","start":180456,"end":180818},{"w":"provider","start":180818,"end":181635},{"w":"to","start":181635,"end":181907},{"w":"the","start":181907,"end":182270},{"w":"major","start":182270,"end":182814},{"w":"programs","start":182814,"end":183630},{"w":"at","start":183630,"end":183903},{"w":"NASA,","start":183903,"end":184447},{"w":"both","start":185072,"end":185405},{"w":"for","start":185405,"end":185671},{"w":"low","start":185671,"end":185937},{"w":"Earth","start":185937,"end":186336},{"w":"orbit","start":186336,"end":186735},{"w":"and","start":186735,"end":187001},{"w":"for","start":187001,"end":187267},{"w":"our","start":187267,"end":187533},{"w":"exploration","start":187533,"end":188103},{"w":"goals","start":188103,"end":188388},{"w":"to","start":188388,"end":188531},{"w":"Moon","start":188531,"end":188768},{"w":"and","start":188768,"end":188958},{"w":"Mars.","start":188958,"end":189243}],"start":179233,"end":189243,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,5,9,13,15,20,25],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"私たちをNASAの主要プログラムに対するサービス提供者と考えることができます。低軌道だけでなく、月や火星への探査目標にも対応しています。","edge":false,"segFrom":76,"segTo":79},{"id":"s13_190369","text":"We plan, we train, and we go execute and fly the missions.","words":[{"w":"We","start":190369,"end":190619},{"w":"plan,","start":190619,"end":191120},{"w":"we","start":191120,"end":191370},{"w":"train,","start":191370,"end":191954},{"w":"and","start":191954,"end":192288},{"w":"we","start":192288,"end":192538},{"w":"go","start":192538,"end":192788},{"w":"execute","start":192788,"end":193244},{"w":"and","start":193244,"end":193472},{"w":"fly","start":193472,"end":193701},{"w":"the","start":193701,"end":193929},{"w":"missions.","start":193929,"end":194499}],"start":190369,"end":194499,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,2,4,8],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"私たちは計画を立て、訓練を行い、ミッションを実行し、飛行します。","edge":false,"segFrom":80,"segTo":81},{"id":"s14_195583","text":"Assigning a crew for a mission is complicated.","words":[{"w":"Assigning","start":195583,"end":196054},{"w":"a","start":196054,"end":196149},{"w":"crew","start":196149,"end":196384},{"w":"for","start":196384,"end":196573},{"w":"a","start":196573,"end":196667},{"w":"mission","start":196667,"end":197376},{"w":"is","start":197376,"end":197642},{"w":"complicated.","start":197642,"end":198794}],"start":195583,"end":198794,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,3,6],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"ミッションに乗組員を割り当てるのは複雑です。","edge":false,"segFrom":82,"segTo":83},{"id":"s15_199462","text":"I'll tell you that.","words":[{"w":"I'll","start":199462,"end":199639},{"w":"tell","start":199639,"end":199817},{"w":"you","start":199817,"end":199958},{"w":"that.","start":199958,"end":200171}],"start":199462,"end":200171,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,3],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"それはあなたに言います。","edge":false,"segFrom":84,"segTo":84},{"id":"s16_200796","text":"We look at our experience base and we say, all right, here's the mission, in this case Artemis 2, higher risk being a test flight.","words":[{"w":"We","start":200796,"end":200905},{"w":"look","start":200905,"end":201086},{"w":"at","start":201086,"end":201194},{"w":"our","start":201194,"end":201339},{"w":"experience","start":201339,"end":201847},{"w":"base","start":201847,"end":202078},{"w":"and","start":202078,"end":202263},{"w":"we","start":202263,"end":202401},{"w":"say,","start":202401,"end":202632},{"w":"all","start":203257,"end":203507},{"w":"right,","start":203507,"end":203946},{"w":"here's","start":203946,"end":204384},{"w":"the","start":204384,"end":204634},{"w":"mission,","start":204634,"end":205203},{"w":"in","start":205203,"end":205392},{"w":"this","start":205392,"end":205708},{"w":"case","start":205708,"end":206024},{"w":"Artemis","start":206024,"end":206529},{"w":"2,","start":206529,"end":206719},{"w":"higher","start":207261,"end":207650},{"w":"risk","start":207650,"end":207928},{"w":"being","start":207928,"end":208262},{"w":"a","start":208262,"end":208373},{"w":"test","start":208373,"end":208651},{"w":"flight.","start":208651,"end":209096}],"start":200796,"end":209096,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,6,9,11,14,19,21],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"私たちは経験ベースを見て、よし、これがミッションだ、今回はアーティミス2、テスト飛行なのでリスクが高い。","edge":false,"segFrom":85,"segTo":89},{"id":"s17_209514","text":"So what complement of experience base do we want on this mission?","words":[{"w":"So","start":209514,"end":209718},{"w":"what","start":209718,"end":210058},{"w":"complement","start":210058,"end":210807},{"w":"of","start":210807,"end":211011},{"w":"experience","start":211011,"end":211759},{"w":"base","start":211759,"end":212099},{"w":"do","start":212099,"end":212278},{"w":"we","start":212278,"end":212457},{"w":"want","start":212457,"end":212755},{"w":"on","start":212755,"end":212934},{"w":"this","start":212934,"end":213232},{"w":"mission?","start":213232,"end":213768}],"start":209514,"end":213768,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,3,6,9],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"では、このミッションにはどのような経験ベースの組み合わせが欲しいのか？","edge":false,"segFrom":90,"segTo":91},{"id":"s18_213768","text":"With a test flight, we typically like pilots that have test flight experience, test pilots.","words":[{"w":"With","start":213768,"end":213949},{"w":"a","start":213949,"end":214022},{"w":"test","start":214022,"end":214203},{"w":"flight,","start":214203,"end":214493},{"w":"we","start":214493,"end":214602},{"w":"typically","start":214602,"end":215284},{"w":"like","start":215284,"end":215625},{"w":"pilots","start":215625,"end":216103},{"w":"that","start":216103,"end":216274},{"w":"have","start":216274,"end":216444},{"w":"test","start":216444,"end":216615},{"w":"flight","start":216615,"end":216854},{"w":"experience,","start":216854,"end":217535},{"w":"test","start":217535,"end":217818},{"w":"pilots.","start":217818,"end":218272}],"start":213768,"end":218272,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,4,8,13],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"試験飛行では、試験飛行の経験があるパイロット、試験パイロットが好まれます。","edge":false,"segFrom":92,"segTo":95},{"id":"s19_219273","text":"In addition to that, you look for cohesiveness with a crew.","words":[{"w":"In","start":219273,"end":219464},{"w":"addition","start":219464,"end":220039},{"w":"to","start":220039,"end":220230},{"w":"that,","start":220230,"end":220613},{"w":"you","start":220613,"end":220868},{"w":"look","start":220868,"end":221187},{"w":"for","start":221187,"end":221442},{"w":"cohesiveness","start":221442,"end":222235},{"w":"with","start":222235,"end":222539},{"w":"a","start":222539,"end":222661},{"w":"crew.","start":222661,"end":223027}],"start":219273,"end":223027,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,4,8],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"さらに、乗組員の一体感も重要です。","edge":false,"segFrom":96,"segTo":97},{"id":"s20_223486","text":"We need mission specialists on board that are able to do a lot of the tasks.","words":[{"w":"We","start":223486,"end":223645},{"w":"need","start":223645,"end":223910},{"w":"mission","start":223910,"end":224334},{"w":"specialists","start":224334,"end":224969},{"w":"on","start":224969,"end":225128},{"w":"board","start":225128,"end":225446},{"w":"that","start":225613,"end":225853},{"w":"are","start":225853,"end":226045},{"w":"able","start":226045,"end":226285},{"w":"to","start":226285,"end":226429},{"w":"do","start":226429,"end":226573},{"w":"a","start":226573,"end":226668},{"w":"lot","start":226668,"end":226860},{"w":"of","start":226860,"end":227004},{"w":"the","start":227004,"end":227196},{"w":"tasks.","start":227196,"end":227532}],"start":223486,"end":227532,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,4,6,11],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"船内には、多くのタスクをこなせるミッションスペシャリストが必要です。","edge":false,"segFrom":98,"segTo":99},{"id":"s21_227990","text":"We go look at an experience base within the office and say, who best can fit these needs?","words":[{"w":"We","start":227990,"end":228137},{"w":"go","start":228137,"end":228284},{"w":"look","start":228284,"end":228530},{"w":"at","start":228530,"end":228677},{"w":"an","start":228677,"end":228824},{"w":"experience","start":228824,"end":229350},{"w":"base","start":229350,"end":229590},{"w":"within","start":229590,"end":229925},{"w":"the","start":229925,"end":230116},{"w":"office","start":230116,"end":230451},{"w":"and","start":230451,"end":230768},{"w":"say,","start":230768,"end":231163},{"w":"who","start":231163,"end":231480},{"w":"best","start":231480,"end":231876},{"w":"can","start":231876,"end":232192},{"w":"fit","start":232192,"end":232509},{"w":"these","start":232509,"end":232984},{"w":"needs?","start":232984,"end":233538}],"start":227990,"end":233538,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,7,10,12],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"オフィス内の経験を調べ、誰がこれらのニーズに最も適しているかを見ます。","edge":false,"segFrom":100,"segTo":102},{"id":"s22_234956","text":"How can they work or will they work together in an environment that's cohesive to aligning to the mission?","words":[{"w":"How","start":234956,"end":235154},{"w":"can","start":235154,"end":235353},{"w":"they","start":235353,"end":235601},{"w":"work","start":235601,"end":235849},{"w":"or","start":235849,"end":235998},{"w":"will","start":235998,"end":236189},{"w":"they","start":236189,"end":236381},{"w":"work","start":236381,"end":236572},{"w":"together","start":236572,"end":236916},{"w":"in","start":237166,"end":237277},{"w":"an","start":237277,"end":237388},{"w":"environment","start":237388,"end":237833},{"w":"that's","start":237833,"end":238292},{"w":"cohesive","start":238292,"end":238882},{"w":"to","start":238882,"end":239079},{"w":"aligning","start":239079,"end":239669},{"w":"to","start":239669,"end":239786},{"w":"the","start":239786,"end":239942},{"w":"mission?","start":239942,"end":240294}],"start":234956,"end":240294,"timing":"line","chunks":[0,4,9,12,14],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"彼らは一体となってミッションに合わせる環境で、どのように働くか、または働くでしょうか？","edge":false,"segFrom":103,"segTo":107}],"segments":[{"text":"<b>Starliner for the crew flight test.</b>","start":117797,"dur":2336},{"text":"<b>These are test flights,</b>","start":120341,"dur":876},{"text":"<b>and they're test flights</b>","start":121592,"dur":751},{"text":"<b>for a reason, because we're making sure</b>","start":122343,"dur":1627},{"text":"<b>that that vehicle's ready to go from an</b>","start":124846,"dur":2127},{"text":"<b>operational standpoint,</b>","start":126973,"dur":1251},{"text":"<b>from that point further.</b>","start":128224,"dur":1460},{"text":"<b>And Artemis is no different.</b>","start":130643,"dur":1835},{"text":"<b>NASA was established to</b>","start":133980,"dur":1710},{"text":"<b>undertake big, bold endeavors</b>","start":135690,"dur":1752},{"text":"<b>in air and space to</b>","start":137650,"dur":1168},{"text":"<b>undertake the near impossible.</b>","start":138818,"dur":1585},{"text":"<b>The next stop is America's</b>","start":140778,"dur":1669},{"text":"<b>return to the lunar environment.</b>","start":142447,"dur":1251},{"text":"<b>What we learned from that mission</b>","start":143906,"dur":1377},{"text":"<b>is going to help enable America's return</b>","start":145283,"dur":2169},{"text":"<b>to the lunar surface.</b>","start":147452,"dur":1001},{"text":"<b>When we arrive to the</b>","start":148828,"dur":792},{"text":"<b>moon, we're there to stay.</b>","start":149620,"dur":1001},{"text":"<b>[APPLAUSE]</b>","start":150663,"dur":2544},{"text":"<b>Our mission calls for four names.</b>","start":153583,"dur":2460},{"text":"<b>It's difficult to pick</b>","start":156961,"dur":1210},{"text":"<b>just four, from a group</b>","start":158171,"dur":2043},{"text":"<b>that by its very definition attracts the</b>","start":160214,"dur":2544},{"text":"<b>best and the brightest</b>","start":162758,"dur":1377},{"text":"<b>that humanity has to</b>","start":164135,"dur":1084},{"text":"<b>offer, as humanity looks to find</b>","start":165219,"dur":2378},{"text":"<b>its place among the stars.</b>","start":167597,"dur":1585},{"text":"<b>My name is Norm Knight. I'm the director</b>","start":170433,"dur":1501},{"text":"<b>of flight operations at</b>","start":171934,"dur":1210},{"text":"<b>NASA Johnson Space Center.</b>","start":173144,"dur":1209},{"text":"<b>Well, let me tell you a little bit about</b>","start":175313,"dur":1084},{"text":"<b>what flight operations does.</b>","start":176397,"dur":2086},{"text":"<b>You could think of us as a service</b>","start":179233,"dur":1585},{"text":"<b>provider to the major programs at NASA,</b>","start":180818,"dur":3629},{"text":"<b>both for low Earth orbit and for our</b>","start":185072,"dur":2461},{"text":"<b>exploration goals to Moon and Mars.</b>","start":187533,"dur":1710},{"text":"<b>We plan, we train, and we go</b>","start":190369,"dur":2419},{"text":"<b>execute and fly the missions.</b>","start":192788,"dur":1711},{"text":"<b>Assigning a crew for a</b>","start":195583,"dur":1084},{"text":"<b>mission is complicated.</b>","start":196667,"dur":2127},{"text":"<b>I'll tell you that.</b>","start":199462,"dur":709},{"text":"<b>We look at our</b>","start":200796,"dur":543},{"text":"<b>experience base and we say,</b>","start":201339,"dur":1293},{"text":"<b>all right, here's the</b>","start":203257,"dur":1377},{"text":"<b>mission, in this case Artemis 2,</b>","start":204634,"dur":2085},{"text":"<b>higher risk being a test flight.</b>","start":207261,"dur":1835},{"text":"<b>So what complement of experience base</b>","start":209514,"dur":2585},{"text":"<b>do we want on this mission?</b>","start":212099,"dur":1669},{"text":"<b>With a test flight, we</b>","start":213768,"dur":834},{"text":"<b>typically like pilots</b>","start":214602,"dur":1501},{"text":"<b>that have test flight</b>","start":216103,"dur":751},{"text":"<b>experience, test pilots.</b>","start":216854,"dur":1418},{"text":"<b>In addition to that, you look for</b>","start":219273,"dur":2169},{"text":"<b>cohesiveness with a crew.</b>","start":221442,"dur":1585},{"text":"<b>We need mission specialists on board</b>","start":223486,"dur":1960},{"text":"<b>that are able to do a lot of the tasks.</b>","start":225613,"dur":1919},{"text":"<b>We go look at an</b>","start":227990,"dur":834},{"text":"<b>experience base within the office</b>","start":228824,"dur":1627},{"text":"<b>and say, who best can fit these needs?</b>","start":230451,"dur":3087},{"text":"<b>How can they work or</b>","start":234956,"dur":1042},{"text":"<b>will they work together</b>","start":235998,"dur":918},{"text":"<b>in an environment</b>","start":237166,"dur":667},{"text":"<b>that's cohesive to aligning</b>","start":237833,"dur":1836},{"text":"<b>to the mission?</b>","start":239669,"dur":625}],"analysisVersion":1,"punctuatedByAi":false,"createdAt":0,"updatedAt":0,"sample":{"level":"C1","topic":"ドキュメンタリー「Moonbound」第 2 話","reason":"計画の背景を語るインタビュー。専門的で速い（約 192 語/分）","wpm":192,"license":"パブリックドメイン（NASA・米国政府の著作物）","credit":"NASA","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ttiLcMUQq80"}}